							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Why respond if you have nothing to add you fucking dolt.<br /><br /><br />TFA = The Fake Angoir<br /><br />Angoir, shaman, was cool as fuck back in lguk days, then I don&#039;t know what happend to him really.&nbsp; He got really edgy and always posting like he had to prove something.&nbsp; Sortof like the twat that posted before me.<br /><br />The reason there is a &#039;fake&#039; added on there is way back when we use to beable to loot corpses, he looted Xxamot&#039;s corpse and he tried to say he was borrowing his brother/friend/lovers account and no one should persecute the &#039;real&#039; angoir.&nbsp; He ended up getting a suspension and was let back with general population.&nbsp; I think he managed to convince people in conviction it wasn&#039;t him, or some shit, so he had a small taste of high end.<br /><br />Basically quite a few people have done this, one other person I remember was that retarded beastlord Kishan=Kazac who applied to ascent and then made a post here going off on them because he coulnd&#039;t find his way through some zone.<br /><br />This information contained here will not benefit you, you ought not be concerned about such things as to its total uselessness.
