							Listen to this guy who knows nothing of what he talks about.<br /><br />I am the fake angoir for a reason, because I am not the real angoir.&nbsp; Me and Graham (real angoir) shared the account up til Kunark and off and on when he actually played (rarely after kunark).&nbsp; Kind of the reason you saw a change in the personality, because it was me - not him.&nbsp; I&#039;m an assohle, he&#039;s a nice guy.&nbsp; I was also Shazbork (whom I pl&#039;d using the Angoir account, then ebayed it) and Ponch.&nbsp; I bet if I mentioned that I had/have access to Riake&#039;s account, you would jump on and spew something about the AOW ninja...wouldn&#039;t you.&nbsp; Then you&#039;d have some super conspiracy theory as to how I own all these accounts and there really is no real riake or real angoir or real ponch (all accounts I did not create, just had access to).<br /><br />Right?<br /><br />God, you&#039;re a fucking tool and a half.
