							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							TFA is right :P.&nbsp; Most of Conviction uses Ventrilo for voice chat, and both Angoir and TFA participated.&nbsp; They are very much two different people.&nbsp; Angoir started playing again around when conviction started for a few months and was a great fit, but then TFA became the primary player on the account after the real angoir burned out or quit for other reasons.&nbsp; TFA was under control and pretty cool for a while so we didn&#039;t mind, but as he got more bored with things, or comfortable, he started to manufacture fun which didn&#039;t go over so well.&nbsp; :P
