							How is what I said untrue?<br /><br />I clearly remember when the Xxamot looting situation happend, it came up on eqvault and you were there trying to say your a friend of the account owners and don&#039;t blame him or some crap.&nbsp; That is the first time that came out of the bag.<br /><br />haha whatever, it don&#039;t matter, so if I misrepresented the history of your life.<br /><br />and I cannot respond to Uuldiin, that response just blows me away hahaha.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
