									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #11 on:</b> December 16, 2004, 04:05:11 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Blondie how can you say that about me when you dont even know me. So what if I troll FV, I am not hurting anyone by doing this. Oh well its not a biggie I have lots of friends in RL and a beautful family, I have done nothing wrong towards anyone on Rodcet or Flamevault!&nbsp; <br /><br />Merry Christmas <br /><br />Colleen Quickness
